# Secrets never belong in this repository.
#
# Production config lives in the Vercel dashboard (Settings -> Environment
# Variables). Local development uses glowmetrics_fresh/.env.local, which is
# ignored by glowmetrics_fresh/.gitignore.
#
# The un-dotted "env.local" at the repo root was committed by mistake and is
# ignored here so it cannot happen again. Nothing reads it: Next.js loads env
# files from the project root (glowmetrics_fresh/), not from here.
env.local
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
